  "summary": "On 12 September 1683 a relief army under King John III Sobieski of Poland attacked the Ottoman army besieging Vienna from the Kahlenberg, north of the city. The Ottoman force under Grand Vizier Kara Mustafa was beaten and he fled. The victory is linked to the later liberation of Hungary from Ottoman rule.",
